{"id":"83e3336972f6f743","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-pi-type.md","title":"df-pi-type","display":"df-pi-type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-pi-type","aliases":["16-df-pi-type","Dependent function type","16-pi-type"],"display":"df-pi-type","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-product]]","[[16-df-set]]"],"source":"Definitions 10.5.1 and 10.5.3 pp.624–625 (PDF644–645), set-family formulas on p.625","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-pi-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-pi-type</span><span>Dependent function type</span><span>16-pi-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi-type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e67b2cc14b2a23ac\" href=\"?note=e67b2cc14b2a23ac\" title=\"16-df-dependent-product\">16-df-dependent-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definitions 10.5.1 and 10.5.3 pp.624–625 (PDF644–645), set-family formulas on p.625"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,\\chi)\">\\((p,\\chi)\\)</span> 是理解范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasPi}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{HasPi}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b2cc14b2a23ac\" href=\"?note=e67b2cc14b2a23ac\" title=\"16-df-dependent-product\">16-df-dependent-product</a> 的完整理解积结构（含 BC）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\">\\(Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{\\pi_X}:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\Pi_{\\pi_X}:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 取该结构在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to I\">\\(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to I\\)</span> 上的同一右伴随见证。</li>\n<li>以下带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> 的公式专用于集合族模型：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的宇宙，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span> 在下文构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)\">\\(\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)\\)</span> 是本页定义的集合族。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{x:X}Y\\coloneqq\\Pi_{\\pi_X}(Y)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{x:X}Y\\coloneqq\\Pi_{\\pi_X}(Y)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\gamma\\mapsto\n\\left\\{f\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{a\\in A(\\gamma)}B(\\gamma,a)\\right)^{A(\\gamma)}\\ \\middle|\\\n(\\forall a\\in A(\\gamma))\\ f(a)\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\right\\}\\right)\\in\\mathcal U^\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\gamma\\mapsto\n\\left\\{f\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{a\\in A(\\gamma)}B(\\gamma,a)\\right)^{A(\\gamma)}\\ \\middle|\\\n(\\forall a\\in A(\\gamma))\\ f(a)\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\right\\}\\right)\\in\\mathcal U^\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>范畴定义作用于同一理解结构的实际纤维，沿理解投影取右伴随；完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasPi}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasPi}\\)</span> 含 BC，与仅要求伴随存在的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)\\)</span> 有意区分。</p>\n<p>集合公式取所有逐点选值的函数。宇宙的小指标积闭包保证它仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小集合族；空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\gamma)\">\\(A(\\gamma)\\)</span> 时得到唯一空函数。它不依赖未定义的括号解释，也不把任意码集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 假定为对依赖积封闭。原书 p.625 的集合族公式就是此构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"e67b2cc14b2a23ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"e67b2cc14b2a23ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$ 是理解范畴，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，假设 $\\mathrm{HasPi}(p,\\chi)$，采用 [[16-df-dependent-product]] 的完整理解积结构（含 BC）。$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$、$Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}$。$\\Pi_{\\pi_X}:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 取该结构在 $\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to I$ 上的同一右伴随见证。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"以下带 $\\mathbf{Set}$ 的公式专用于集合族模型：$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$ 为 [[16-df-set]] 的宇宙，$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U$、$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$、$B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U$，其中 $\\Gamma.A$ 在下文构造。$\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)$ 是本页定义的集合族。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasPi}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{\\pi_X}:\\mathcal E_{\\{X\\}}\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"B:\\Gamma.A\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{x:X}Y\\coloneqq\\Pi_{\\pi_X}(Y)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^{\\mathbf{Set}}_A(B)&\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\gamma\\mapsto\n\\left\\{f\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{a\\in A(\\gamma)}B(\\gamma,a)\\right)^{A(\\gamma)}\\ \\middle|\\\n(\\forall a\\in A(\\gamma))\\ f(a)\\in B(\\gamma,a)\\right\\}\\right)\\in\\mathcal U^\\Gamma.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasPi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasDepForall}(q,D_\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":2054,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pi-type|df-pi-type]]"}],"outgoing":["e67b2cc14b2a23ac","09b2ae01fb2d54e3"]}